        {
          "text": "Le okwot pö amörostin ompö Yerusalem ompö osiswo ichontinekwa, kinyïghï nyu pich kanastin, kunkïtï nyu chane lö, ochan ECHOTYON.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
